  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Well-ventilated structured fabric upper\n\tLow profile with lightly padded tongue and collar for comfortable mobility\n\tBungee lace panel for a secure fit\n\tHeel pull tab offers an easy slip-on and off\n\tProtective bumper toe\n\t270 Max Air unit and soft foam midsole for elevated, lightweight comfort\n\tGrippy rubber sole with grooves for durable traction\n\tThe Nike Air Max 270 Casual Shoes are imported\nFrom crawling to walking to running, the Kids' Toddler Nike Air Max 270 Casual Shoes will have your adventurous tot ready to go. With an easy-on design and a breathable upper material, these sneakers ensure little feet are supported as kids play!</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids' Toddler Nike Air Max 270 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Toddler</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Light Smoke Grey/Pink Foam</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3242525</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; fo